{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22294","headline":"舟中李山人访宿 · 白居易","name":"舟中李山人访宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮舟悄悄，烟生水沈沈。\n何以延宿客，夜酒与秋琴。\n来客道门子，来自嵩高岑。\n轩轩举云貌，豁豁开清襟。\n得意言语断，入玄滋味深。\n默然相顾哂，心适而忘心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}